:: StoryTitle
Twee-Glass

:: StoryData
{"format": "Chapbook", "format-version": "2.3.0", "ifid": "C67460F1-5CAD-42EC-AF08-E1A7249DBCE8", "start": "Prologue-Intro"}

:: Prologue-Intro
The Prince sits awkwardly on the couch, holding his glass slipper and trying to keep it from crushing. Lucinda and Theodora have the ends of the same couch, and the old lady leans toward him: 'Do tell me about your father's health.' It is your business to steer the talk.

[[Take up the Prologue talk|S1-Prologue-Hub]]
